  "title": "Crusted Salmon with Honey-Mustard Sauce",
  "description": "This delightful salmon recipe crusts fillets with a breadcrumb-Parmesan mixture, bakes them, and then tops with a flavorful honey-mustard-butter sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "Evan"
  ],
  "date_published": "2016-06-04T09:55:46-04:00",
